	},
	{
		{"text"},
		line=893,
	},
	{
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat010050d"},
		line=893,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"Despite staying up almost all of last night, sleep doesn't come for me.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"My whole body is tense, as though thin needles are flowing through my veins.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"“Now then, let us hear your answer, Your Highness.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"“Will you give up on the chancellor and go back to Iseya, or will you cruelly leave this man to die?”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"The man presses his dagger to Soujin's neck.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Soujin's face is soaked in blood and destitute of any signs of life.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I-I'll...”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, remember the pledge you made at the grave!”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No lord should have to abandon their ambitions for the sake of a mere vassal.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Soujin says all this to me with a kindly smile on his face.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"Oh, Soujin...",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"I... I...",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			{
"“Your answer?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Grgh!”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			{
"The dagger bites into Soujin's neck.",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			{
"The blade rends his flesh and soaks his skin with blood.",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"And still, the dagger digs deeper, and deeper still into his neck.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Pl...”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			{
"The words catch in my throat.",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			{
"The final, desperate act of resistance from the last of my reason.",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"But even this is washed away by the deluge of my feelings.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Please don't kill him!”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't kill Soujin!”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There's nobody else in the world I hold more dear!”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm begging you, please don't kill him!”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"The floodgates of my feelings are thrown wide open.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"I couldn't hold anything back even if I tried.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Laying myself at his feet, I beg him over and over to spare\nSoujin's life.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"Petals of Persica scatter all around me.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"They flutter down and pile up on this prostrate girl with foolish former dreams of empire.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari...”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm begging you, don't kill him!”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"“You give up on Okonogi, then?”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I give up. Please just spare Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"“I see. So you would choose the life of a single man over the sum of your ambitions. Heh, heheheh...”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“...Yes.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"“Begone from Tenkyo by the time of the ceremony.”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			{
"“Do not break your word to me.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"“Hahaha! Ahahahahahaha!”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"Those moments replay themselves over and over in my head.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"Soujin tells me it was all a dream, but it's more than real enough for me.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"I chose Soujin's life over the pledge I made to Mother.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"In just a few short days, I already broke my vow to always live for the sake of our people.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Seems like I'm all talk and no action.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“First I pass out in the Warrior District, and now I've gone and let you get kidnapped...”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If ever you decide that you're better off without me, just say the word.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"I think of Soujin's words to me.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"They were definitely intended as a challenge.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"“Such is the depth of my resolve to serve. And what of your resolve?”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(I'm the one who's all talk.)”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(I was never fit to be his lord.)”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"I can't possibly be the one to save the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"I'm unworthy of being the cause for which the warriors risk their lives to fight.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Soujin deserves better than to lay his life down for someone the likes of me.",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(I'm so sorry, Soujin...)”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"Peach petals flutter down all around me.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"They sneeringly demand I go back to Iseya.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Shut up.)”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"I crush the petals dancing in the air.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"True, I'm unfit to be his lord.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"But if I go back to Iseya just like this, I'll never be able to face Mother and the rest of my ancestors.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"I at least have to do everything I can, for the sake of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"The 19th of March, the Persica Blossom Festival is in full swing.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"The streets are thronged with revelers.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"Flocks of customers looking to purchase peach flowers make their way to Koujiya Flowers.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"The specialty picnic lunches we sell on behalf of Miyoshi are an especially big hit.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Three Persica branches, sir? Just one moment, please.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Here's your two picnic lunches. Thank you for your patronage!”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Even with Akari helping out, we just barely manage to keep things running.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, we need more peach flowers!”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Got it.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"I adorn a branch with festival decorations and hand it over.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"It's customary for the people of Tenkyo to decorate their houses with these branches during the Persica Blossom Festival.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"It's the busiest time of the year for us florists.",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"Especially because the city's peach trees bloomed late this year, the beautiful Persica branches we're selling will fly off the shelves.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thank you for waiting. Please enjoy the festival!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Without exception, all of our male customers double back for one last look at Akari before leaving the store.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Akari sure makes for an excellent saleswoman.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"She memorizes every single order the first time, and reproduces it with perfect precision.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"But most of all, she has that outstanding smile of hers.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"Even though storm clouds still hang low in the Tenkyo sky, our store is filled with nothing but the fresh sunshine of spring.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Good morning to you.”",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Welcome!”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, it's you, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh? Akari-sama, whyever are you doing simple labor?!”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's my way of repaying them for taking care of me all the time.”",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What're you doing here?”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I have arrived to deliver that which was requested of me.”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Kotone passes a paper bag over to Akari.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thanks for coming all this way.”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What'd you ask her for?”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I had her Hone the blade I carry for self-defense.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is a most fine work of craftsmanship, very befitting one of Akari-sama's station.”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you had just said the word, I would've gone to pick it up.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“No, no, perish the thought.”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“As a matter of fact, I wished to personally come and observe the festival.”",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ah, so that's why you're wearing your casual clothes.”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Indeed, she would turn quite a few eyes if she came decked out in her priestess vestments.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“They look good on you.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“P-P-P-Perish the thought!”",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“What a lamentable fate for these clothes, that they would look good on the likes of me!”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"The incomprehensible bout of self-abasement aside, she does still seem pleased at the compliment.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"As we exchange pleasantries, more and more customers enter the store.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Welcome!”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My apologies, I seem to be getting in the way.”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry. We're awfully busy today.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Um, if you would not be opposed, sir, might I offer my assistance?”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your Eminence of all people, working at a humble flower shop?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I do not believe there are any rules that forbid it.”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"With a cheerful smile, Kotone immediately begins rolling up her sleeves.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Welcome! The peach flowers are right this way.”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“These are specialty lunches from Miyoshi. A most excellent accompaniment for admiring the flowers!”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"The shop adds another beautiful flower to its collection, and somehow becomes even brighter.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"Were I to liken Akari to a flower, a blossom of Persica she would undoubtedly be.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"For they both share a rarified beauty; born of an elegant refinement, a peerless grace.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"By contrast, I suppose Kotone would be a sunflower?",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"After all, her carefree smile is so radiantly bright that just a mere glimpse is enough to lift your spirits.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I never thought I'd ever be lifting boxes with the Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'd bet there's never been a more august flower shop in the history of the Empire.”",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“A most humbling thought, indeed.”",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“That said, to support the Empress has always been the station of the Exalt-Priestess, so perhaps this is altogether fitting and proper.”",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"The Empress and the Exalt-Priestess...",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"I hope to see them standing side-by-side in the near future, facing the rejoicing citizens of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Just past four of the clock in the afternoon, the last of our peach flowers have sold out far faster than expected.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"Our work for the shop is all done with.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"Kotone leaves to attend to her duties, and Akari and I decide to go see the sights of the city.",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"Lively music flows through the crowded streets, and every last face we pass by is filled with bright cheer.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			{
"The entire shopping district seems to come alive with excited energy.",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Is there anywhere we can go to see the peach flowers in bloom?”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The school courtyard, maybe? I remember it getting plenty of sunlight, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Why don't we go check? I've seen enough cuttings to last a lifetime. I wanna see the real deal!”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Some flower shop employee you are...”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Whoops! Excuuuse me.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			{
"Akari sticks out her tongue at me.",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"I make for the academy alongside an Akari full of smiles.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"My memory serves me well. The peach blossoms in the school courtyard light up the surroundings with their vivid colors.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"It being the weekend, the courtyard is completely deserted, and we have the flowers all to ourselves.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"We sit down side-by-side on a nearby bench and silently admire the blossoms for a while.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"These flowers are just beginning to spread their petals.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"They can't match the splendor of Persica in full bloom, but they do give off a youthful sense of freshness all their own.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You like peach flowers?”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I sure do.”",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But... how do I put this? Whenever I look at them, I can't help but feel a little sad.”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Maybe I have some sad memories of them that I've since forgotten.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Maybe a girl you liked shot you down?”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hahaha, I sure hope that's not the case.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"I laugh and make a joke out of it.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"But it's true that I can't remember a single thing.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"Nonetheless, this feeling of tightness in my chest is still strangely vivid, even after all this time.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What about you?”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's complicated for me, too.”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I think they're beautiful, but seeing them also makes me want to cry.”",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It feels like there's a deep sadness buried within these flowers.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			{
"Akari stands and walks up to a nearby peach tree.",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			{
"She draws a branch down close to her face.",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"The lovely pink of the flowers perfectly complements\nAkari's features.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"Such a sight should make my heart soar, but for some reason, my chest is a whirlwind of restless emotions.",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Persica blossoms and Akari...",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"It is as though there is an inexorable force which eternally binds the two together.",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I wonder what the Empire will be like this time next year.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It'd be wonderful if you were standing in front of the people as their Empress.”",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Think that'll really happen?”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll make it happen. The two of us, together.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll make it a Persica Blossom Festival to end all festivals.”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"Akari draws her brow together in a bittersweet smile that tugs at my heartstrings.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, yeah! Wanna see that Dance of Persica I was telling you about?”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, the dance passed down in the Imperial Family, was it?”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Is it really okay to show that to someone like me?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Today's a special day.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Then by all means. I'd never dream of refusing.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"There could be few honors higher than bearing witness to a dance secretly passed down through generations of the Imperial Family.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			{
"She responds with a simple nod, and unfurls her fan.",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"Akari stands perfectly still.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"In this illusory moment, even time itself comes to a breathless halt.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"The surroundings are enveloped in tranquility, and inexorably, I feel my consciousness being drawn to her.",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Her extended arms begin slowly gliding through the air, and only then does time dare to resume its own advance.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"She moves with a surreptitious grace that extends all the way to the tips of her fingers.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"In this moment, Akari is an unripe bud, patiently waiting for the coming spring before blossoming forth.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			{
"Once again, she falls breathlessly still.",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"As though noticing a sign, her gaze is fixed towards a distant point in the faraway firmament.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"A season of change arrives.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Her skirts billow wide as she whirls about on the spot.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			{
"She is beginning to blossom.",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			{
"Her dance slowly picks up speed.",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			{
"Faster, as she spreads her petals.",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			{
"Faster yet, as she approaches full bloom.",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"And even faster still, as her movements reach their climax, resplendent in majesty.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"The entire vast courtyard has become her stage.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"As she whirls about it, she is a solitary bloom of Persica that bathes her surroundings in radiance.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"The multitudes of flowers in the background no longer register in my view.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			{
"Akari draws in all the light from her surroundings, and all I see is her.",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"In that moment, an ageless peach orchard stretches out before my eyes.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"Petals of Persica scatter down and bury the gentle hillside.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			{
"I'm enveloped by the fluttering haze of spring.",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			{
"And in the midst of that intoxicating fragrance, a lone girl continues to dance.",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Is that Akari?)”",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			{
"The girl proffers me a gentle smile in lieu of an answer.",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"I find myself lost in those intense, yet ephemeral eyes of hers.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			{
"Her forlorn smile reminds me that there is no flower that does not eventually wither.",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"─Alas, o beloved, tell me why.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"─Must you continue your fight, even unto your tears run dry?",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			{
"I reach my hand out involuntarily.",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			{
"My fingertips lightly graze the falling petals.",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"...What was that I just saw?",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"Even as I watched Akari dance, my heart wandered off to some distant spring.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			{
"Her movements, once filled with vitality, now begin to take on a melancholic note.",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"A flower past its peak has but one fate.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"To wither and scatter.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"All around Akari, petals of Persica dance upon the air.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			{
"Is this too an illusion, conjured by the otherworldly beauty of her dance?",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			{
"Her graceful movements contain all the answer I need.",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"They gradually grow smaller and smaller.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"And yet the depth of their emotion only intensifies, until every last sorrow known to man is condensed into the minute movements of her fingertips.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"My breath is stolen away.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"Her graceful, outstretched fingertips finally come to a rest.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"Between them, a single petal of Persica silently flutters to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			{
"Akari slowly snaps her fan shut.",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"Her long, thin exhale of breath finally returns me to reality.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What'd you think?”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			{
"Forgetting how to even reply, I simply continue staring vacantly at her.",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, were you even watching?”",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah. Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It was beautiful... heart-wrenchingly so.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's good to hear.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			{
"There's a deep sadness lurking beneath the smile she gives me.",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll never forget what I saw here today.”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Consider it recompense for everything you've done for me.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But I haven't done anything yet.”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In fact, I've done nothing but fail you.”",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Same goes for me. There's so much I have to apologize for.”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Really? Nothing comes to mind.”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah... Maybe you're right.”",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			{
"Akari says this with a bittersweet smile.",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			{
"It's a smile that evokes not the splendor of a flower in full bloom, but the fragile transience of a flower's final moments.",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			{
"The very same smile I saw earlier in my reverie.",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			{
"My heart is strangely restless.",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			{
"Why did Akari decide to show me the dance now, when she was so resistant earlier?",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"What did she mean by “having so much to apologize for?”",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari, what are you thinking?”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			{
"For a moment, Akari's eyes widen, but she soon slips on a mask of a smile.",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Just wondering what's for dinner tonight, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Come on. We both know that's not true.”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Gosh, Soujin, cut it out with the weird accusations.”",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“C'mon, let's head home.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's been ages since I danced like that. I'm starving!”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			{
"Without waiting for me, Akari starts walking.",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari!”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Get a move on, or I'm gonna leave you behind!”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			{
"Akari doesn't turn around.",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"The sight of her receding figure, slowly being swallowed up by the twilight, heightens my sense of unease all the more.",
			},
		},
